--- OLD
  @Begin:
    JSR ClearZeroPage               ; clear Zero Page for good measure
--- NEW
  @Begin:
    JSR ClearZeroPage               ; clear Zero Page for good measure

.import rando_stale, rando_coldbuild
.export DisableAPU                  ; for the randomizer and the harness
    ;  The randomizer's world, built here from the save Continue just loaded
    ;  -- before any game code runs, so the build's pause falls in the
    ;  transition into the game rather than on the first step, battle or menu
    ;  that wants it.  New Game built it before party creation
    ;  (rando_newgame), and after a soft reset WRAM, and so the cache, is
    ;  intact: both only compare the tag.  The consumers still ensure, a check
    ;  that should now never fire.
    ;
    ;  When there is a build, rando_coldbuild silences the title's music --
    ;  nothing drives it meanwhile -- and puts up New Game's roll screen for
    ;  it, the save's own sprite, and its fanfare.  A soft reset's Continue
    ;  keeps its music and its frames.  PrepOverworld starts the overworld's
    ;  track next, and a new track turns the channels back on.
    JSL rando_stale + RANDOFAR
    BCC :+
      JSL rando_coldbuild + RANDOFAR
  :
